<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-PRINOSIL BEATS KORDA IN CZECH OPEN FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PRINOSIL BEATS KORDA IN CZECH OPEN FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>OSTRAVA, Czech Republic 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the</p>
<p>final of the $475,000 Czech Open indoor tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Sunday:</p>
<p>David Prinosil (Germany) beat Petr Korda (Czech Republic) 6-1</p>
<p>6-2</p>
</text>
